       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PAYROLL.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-HOURS PIC 9(3).
       01 WS-RATE PIC 9(4).
       01 WS-GROSS PIC 9(7).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           ACCEPT WS-HOURS.
           ACCEPT WS-RATE.
           COMPUTE WS-GROSS = WS-HOURS * WS-RATE.
           DISPLAY "GROSS PAY: " WS-GROSS.
           STOP RUN.
